@page "/"

<PageTitle>Edel - C# Developer & UI Explorer</PageTitle>

<!-- Tailwind CDN -->
<head>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
.blueprint-bg {
    background-color: #1d4ed8;
    background-image: 
        linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 20px 20px;
}
    </style>
</head> 

<div class="bg-[#fafaf9] text-gray-800 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-sky-200 selection:text-sky-900 min-h-screen">

    <!-- Header -->
<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-[#fafaf9]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-stone-200/50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500"></span>
            Edel Detablan
        </a>
        <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600">
            <a href="#about" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition">About</a>
            <a href="#focus" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition">Focus</a>
            <a href="#journey" class="hover:text-sky-600 transition">Journey</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="Edel_Detablan_Resume.pdf" download="Edel_Detablan_CV.pdf" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-...">
            Download CV ↓
        </a>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-24 md:pt-20 md:pb-32">
    <div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12">
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 text-center flex flex-col items-center space-y-4">
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
                Hi, I’m Edel!
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium text-gray-700">
                C# Developer & UI Explorer
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
                Building modern web applications with Blazor and Tailwind CSS.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
                <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border border-sky-200">C# / .NET</span>
                <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border border-sky-200">Blazor</span>
                <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border border-sky-200">Tailwind CSS</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex justify-center">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-sky-100 shadow-xl border-4 border-white w-72 h-80">
                <img src="1.jpg" alt="Edel Portrait" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

        <!-- ABOUT ME SECTION -->
        <section id="about" class="bg-[#f5f5f3] pt-32 pb-20 border-y border-stone-200">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-sky-800 uppercase mb-4">ABOUT ME</p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif italic text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-8">
                    “A cup of coffee to start the day, and clean C# code to keep it going.”
                </h2>
                <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    <p>Hi! I’m Edel. As an Information Technology graduate with a strong background in C# development, I’ve always enjoyed solving technical problems and building reliable software.</p>
                    <p>Recently, I’ve jumped headfirst into the world of UI/UX design, blending my backend C# logic with interactive frontends using Blazor and Tailwind CSS. I believe great software isn’t just about code that works under the hood—it’s also about creating intuitive, beautiful experiences people using it.</p>
                    <p>When I’m not coding or tweaking design layouts, you’ll usually find me experimenting with new frameworks, sharing tech knowledge, or brewing a fresh batch of coffee.</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-12 font-medium">at little about me</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TOOLKIT SECTION -->
        <section id="focus" class="py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 scroll-mt-28">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-14">
                <div class="lg:col-span-5">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-900 leading-tight">
                        My toolkit,<br><span class="italic font-normal">in practice.</span>
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-600 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    <p>I'm growing across the full stack—connecting thoughtful engineering with interfaces people enjoy using.</p>
                    <p>Drawing from experiences in C#, the .NET ecosystem, and my focus on component-driven interfaces using Blazor and Tailwind CSS, I am growing across the full stack—connecting thoughtful engineering with interfaces people enjoy using. A background in robust QA processes ensures every application I build is reliable and scalable.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4 Ice Blue Pill Cards -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-sky-100/70 p-7 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-700 block mb-4">01</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-slate-900 mb-3">Backend foundations</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Building reliable and scalable application logic with C# and the .NET ecosystem.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-sky-200/60 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800">C# &bull; .NET</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-sky-100/70 p-7 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-700 block mb-4">02</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-slate-900 mb-3">Modern interfaces</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Creating responsive, interactive, and component-user experiences with Blazor.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-sky-200/60 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800">Blazor</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-sky-100/70 p-7 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-700 block mb-4">03</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-slate-900 mb-3">Clean visual systems</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Using Tailwind CSS to turn clear design thinking into polished, aesthetic UIs.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-sky-200/60 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800">Tailwind CSS</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-sky-100/70 p-7 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-700 block mb-4">04</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-slate-900 mb-3">Full-stack validation</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Rigorous testing and end-to-end validation across the stack to ensure system integrity.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-sky-200/60 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800">QA &bull; Testing</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- THE JOURNEY CONTINUES -->
        <section id="journey" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24 scroll-mt-28">
            <div class="blueprint-bg rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 text-white shadow-2xl">
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-amber-400 uppercase mb-6">THE JOURNEY CONTINUES</p>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-normal leading-tight mb-8 max-w-3xl">
                    Coding with purpose.<br>
                    Growing through <span class="italic text-amber-300 font-serif">practice.</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="text-blue-100 text-base sm:text-xl max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-10">
                    I'm eager to share my C++/C# applications, system architecture experiments, and development journey with you.
                </p>
                <a href="#" class="text-white font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl border-b-2 border-white pb-1 hover:border-amber-300 hover:text-amber-300 transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>Download my CV</span>
                    <span>→</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
  

    <footer class="bg-stone-100 border-t border-stone-200 py-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Edel. C# & Blazor Developer Portfolio.</p>
    </footer>
</div>